  "content_rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-1 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-background has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color\" style=\"width:calc(18px + 20px);height:calc(18px + 20px)\"><i style=\"font-size:18px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font  has-text-color has-black-color fa-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-vk-heading-plain\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-envelope\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>お問い合わせ</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">まずはお気軽にお問い合わせください。LINE、インスタグラム、Facebook、メールでもご利用いただけます。</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-6 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-button vk_button vk_button-color-custom vk_button-align-wide\"><a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"vk_button_link btn has-background has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color btn has-text-color has-black-color btn-lg\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"vk_button_link_caption\"><span class=\"vk_button_link_txt\">お問い合わせフォーム</span></div></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">受付時間０９：００－１８：００（月曜　定休日）</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon vk_block-margin-0--margin-top vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center is-style-noline\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color\" style=\"width:calc(40px + 0px);height:calc(40px + 0px)\"><i style=\"font-size:40px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font fa-angles-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-background has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color\" style=\"width:calc(18px + 20px);height:calc(18px + 20px)\"><i style=\"font-size:18px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font  has-text-color has-black-color fa-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-vk-heading-plain\">ご提案・お見積り</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">ヒアリングした内容を元にお客様にベストなプランとお見積りをご提案させていただきます。<br>絶対にはずせないものや既に決まっているプランなどお知らせください。</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon vk_block-margin-0--margin-top vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center is-style-noline\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color\" style=\"width:calc(40px + 0px);height:calc(40px + 0px)\"><i style=\"font-size:40px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font fa-angles-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-background has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color\" style=\"width:calc(18px + 20px);height:calc(18px + 20px)\"><i style=\"font-size:18px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font  has-text-color has-black-color fa-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-vk-heading-plain\">お申し込み</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">お客様のご希望のプランと日時を申込用フォームにご記入下さい。<br>キャンセルポリシーなどご確認ください。</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon vk_block-margin-0--margin-top vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center is-style-noline\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color\" style=\"width:calc(40px + 0px);height:calc(40px + 0px)\"><i style=\"font-size:40px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font fa-angles-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-background has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color\" style=\"width:calc(18px + 20px);height:calc(18px + 20px)\"><i style=\"font-size:18px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font  has-text-color has-black-color fa-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-vk-heading-plain\">LINEサポート開始</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">グアムについて聞きたい事や行きたい場所などを相談しながら最適なプランを作りましょう。</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon vk_block-ma